---
// Benefits.astro - Methodology and key benefits of training at Domus Voley
---

<section id="metodologia" class="py-20 md:py-32 relative bg-[#05131d] overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle lighting -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-teal-500/10 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="section-header text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 md:mb-20">
      <span class="text-teal-400 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest inline-block mb-3">
        // METODOLOGÍA & EXPERIENCIA
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase text-white leading-tight mb-5">
        ¿Por qué elegir a <span class="text-gradient">Domus Voleibol Club</span>?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg">
        Nos apasiona enseñar vóley con altos estándares técnicos en un ambiente donde siempre te sentirás motivado y respaldado.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Benefits Grid -->
    <div class="benefits-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Benefit 1 -->
      <div class="benefit-card card-glass rounded-3xl p-8 border border-teal-500/20 hover:border-teal-400/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-teal-950/40 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-teal-500/20 text-teal-300 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-teal-500 group-hover:text-[#05131d] transition-all duration-300">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7 7z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-white mb-3">
          Entrenadores Calificados
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Cuerpo técnico con sólida formación deportiva y pedagógica. Correcciones posturales individuales para potenciar tu salto, precisión y evitar lesiones.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Benefit 2 -->
      <div class="benefit-card card-glass rounded-3xl p-8 border border-teal-500/20 hover:border-teal-400/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-teal-950/40 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-teal-500/20 text-teal-300 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-teal-500 group-hover:text-[#05131d] transition-all duration-300">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-white mb-3">
          Instalaciones de Primer Nivel
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Entrenamos en las amplias y seguras losas del Colegio Teresa González de Fanning en Jesús María, con acceso céntrico y seguridad permanente.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Benefit 3 -->
      <div class="benefit-card card-glass rounded-3xl p-8 border border-teal-500/20 hover:border-teal-400/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-teal-950/40 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-teal-500/20 text-teal-300 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-teal-500 group-hover:text-[#05131d] transition-all duration-300">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-white mb-3">
          Balones & Material Oficial
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Trabajamos con balones reglamentarios, redes profesionales, implementos de salto y coordinación para que sientas la verdadera experiencia del vóley.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Benefit 4 -->
      <div class="benefit-card card-glass rounded-3xl p-8 border border-teal-500/20 hover:border-teal-400/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-teal-950/40 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-teal-500/20 text-teal-300 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-teal-500 group-hover:text-[#05131d] transition-all duration-300">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-white mb-3">
          Partidos en Cada Clase
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          La teoría y la técnica se consolidan jugando. Dedicamos tiempo en cada entrenamiento para partidos dirigidos con arbitraje y rotaciones guiadas.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Benefit 5 -->
      <div class="benefit-card card-glass rounded-3xl p-8 border border-teal-500/20 hover:border-teal-400/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-teal-950/40 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-teal-500/20 text-teal-300 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-teal-500 group-hover:text-[#05131d] transition-all duration-300">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-white mb-3">
          Horarios Flexibles
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Opciones entre semana y fines de semana. Turnos en la tarde y noche para que entrenar sea compatible con tu colegio, universidad o trabajo.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Benefit 6 -->
      <div class="benefit-card card-glass rounded-3xl p-8 border border-teal-500/20 hover:border-teal-400/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-teal-950/40 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-teal-500/20 text-teal-300 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-teal-500 group-hover:text-[#05131d] transition-all duration-300">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-white mb-3">
          Comunidad & Confraternidad
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Más que entrenar, te unirás a un grupo sano, respetuoso y apasionado donde harás grandes amigos y vivirás la emoción de los torneos.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
